    "title": "Kennewick man sentenced for deadly August hit-and-run crash in Pasco - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Mark Rattner NonStop Local Digital Journalist ,\n5 hours ago PASCO, Wash. — A Kennewick man was sentenced to 4 ½ years Tuesday after pleading guilty to charges in a deadly hit and run crash in Pasco. Daniel Gonzalez-Salaz, 43, pleaded guilty to vehicular homicide in Franklin County Court and failure to stop and identify at the scene of an accident resulting in death, according to court documents. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
